{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/amra-residences-citi-developers-umm-al-quwain","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1356,"crm_id":null,"search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Amra Residences","slug":"amra-residences-citi-developers-umm-al-quwain","display_address":"Umm Al Quwain Marina","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Citi Developers","price":790000,"display_price":"790K","lattitude":25.0254441,"longitude":55.2243809,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"1,3","about":"<p>Amra Phase 2 Umm Al Quwain forms part of the world’s first integrative wellness destination, thoughtfully positioned in Al Raudah within a protected Blue Carbon Zone. As Phase 2 of a five-tower master vision, it introduces Towers D and E, rising 15 floors and offering fully furnished, serviced residences shaped around holistic living, with ownership beginning from a 10% down payment.</p><p>Amra Phase 2 by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-citi-developers/\">Citi Developers</a> blends hospitality-grade services with wellness-led architecture, supported by over 750,000 sq. ft. dedicated to amenities and the Seven Pillars of Integrative Wellness. Designed to meet rising global demand for wellness-driven living, the project is positioned to deliver strong long-term capital appreciation within a rare coastal ecosystem.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_1ac558058c.jpg","hash":"Feature_1ac558058c","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_37a089730b.jpg","hash":"Banner_37a089730b","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_11_