me":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Amra Phase 2 Umm Al Quwain by Citi Developers Defines Wellness-Driven Waterfront Living","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Location in a Protected Blue Carbon Zone – Positioned within a rare coastal ecosystem that enhances environmental value and long-term sustainability.</li><li>World’s First Integrative Wellness Resort – Built entirely around the Seven Pillars of Integrative Wellness, shaping daily life, design, and experiences.</li><li>Fully Furnished and Serviced Residences – Studio, 1, and 3-bedroom apartments delivered with hotel-style services and operational ease.</li><li>750,000 Sq. Ft. of Wellness and Lifestyle Amenities – An expansive, purpose-built amenity ecosystem unmatched in scale within the region.</li><li>High Capital Appreciation Potential – Wellness tourism demand, coastal scarcity, and infrastructure growth support long-term value.</li><li>Post-Handover Payment Flexibility – Structured ownership approach aligned with extended post-completion investment planning.</li><li>Developer-Led Hospitality Operations – Citi Developers integrate concierge, dining, wellness, and short-stay management into ownership.</li><li>Sea-View Living Across the Development – Every residence and amenity zone is oriented toward water, lagoon, or coastal vistas.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1946,"cta":{"id":2760,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_0c4a24920f.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_0c4a24920f","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"A Waterfront Wellness Sanctuary in Umm Al Quwain","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>